Seven of the nine candidates are false positives or metadata-blocked after full text: the rice HNT paper has no metal data; the arsenic chapter has no extractable concentration table; the analytical/remediation/materials papers are not food occurrence; and the milk paper has usable values but the DOI is not present in the PDF text, so it fails the strict metadata gate. The one clean real ingest candidate is Souri 2019 on leafy vegetables.
